{"data":{"ExtRef_Child_hu_note":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"（甲寅、五四）","note_content_jianti_auto":"（甲寅、五四）","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94ee93eb-db0e-11ef-8952-a0d3651f611f"},"ExtRef_Children_contents":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"孔子","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔子","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"94ee93ee-db0e-11ef-ae76-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"論語記孔子之言。","note_content_jianti_auto":"论语记孔子之言。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"94ee93ed-db0e-11ef-bd2b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94ee93f1-db0e-11ef-b25e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"許愼","people_name_jianti_auto":"许愼","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"94ee93f2-db0e-11ef-ba4d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蒼頡","people_name_jianti_auto":"苍颉","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"94ee93f3-db0e-11ef-92ed-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"五帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"五帝","start_index":111,"tongjian_id":"94ee93f4-db0e-11ef-9e68-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"三王","people_name_jianti_auto":"三王","start_index":114,"tongjian_id":"94ee93f5-db0e-11ef-842a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"泰山","place_name_jianti_auto":"泰山","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"94ee93f6-db0e-11ef-8647-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"梁父","place_name_jianti_auto":"梁父","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"94ee93f7-db0e-11ef-b586-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"泰山","place_name_jianti_auto":"泰山","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"94ee93f8-db0e-11ef-bb8c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：莊子曰：易姓而王，封於泰山，禪於梁父者，七十有二代；其有形兆垠堮，勒石凡千八百餘處。許愼說文·序曰：蒼頡之初作書，蓋依類象形，故謂之文；其有形聲相益，卽謂之字。字者，言孳乳而滋多也。著於竹帛，謂之書。書者，如也。以迄五帝、三王之世，改易殊體，封於泰山者，七十有二代，靡有同焉。汙，烏故翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：庄子曰：易姓而王，封于泰山，禅于梁父者，七十有二代；其有形兆垠堮，勒石凡千八百余处。许愼说文·序曰：苍颉之初作书，盖依类象形，故谓之文；其有形声相益，即谓之字。字者，言孳乳而滋多也。著于竹帛，谓之书。书者，如也。以迄五帝、三王之世，改易殊体，封于泰山者，七十有二代，靡有同焉。污，乌故翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"94ee93f0-db0e-11ef-802f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"林放","people_name_jianti_auto":"林放","people_xingming":"林放","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"94ee93fc-db0e-11ef-9351-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"94ee93ec-db0e-11ef-b0ef-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"kūn","source_anchor_text":"稱虛美必髡令屯田於","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":95,"text":"髡","tongjian_id":"d5a5d721-e751-5777-9268-2189b25498bf"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"泰山","place_name_jianti_auto":"泰山","resolved_place_entity_id":306,"start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"94ee93fd-db0e-11ef-a7d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"泰山","place_name_jianti_auto":"泰山","resolved_place_entity_id":306,"start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"94ee93fe-db0e-11ef-8111-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/汉唐封禅","excerpts":[{"context_after":"从此群臣不敢复言。后二年，上斋，夜读《河图会昌符》，曰“...","context_before":"","source_end_index":88,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"3d4cfbde-c946-458c-85c8-21e9b0824bd5","source_start_index":0,"source_text":"汉光武建武三十年，车驾东巡，群臣上言，即位三十年，宜封禅泰山。诏曰：“即位三十年，百姓怨气满腹，吾谁欺？欺天乎！何事污七十二代之编录！若郡县远遣吏上寿，盛称虚美，必髠令屯田。”"}],"path":"随笔/卷十一/汉唐封禅","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"容斋随笔/光武苻坚","excerpts":[{"context_after":"然财二年间，乃因读《河图会昌符》，诏索《河》《雒》谶文言...","context_before":"","source_end_index":79,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ed49988b-cec2-424a-b745-0d85b37faa06","source_start_index":0,"source_text":"汉光武建武三十年，群臣请封禅泰山。诏曰：“即位三十年，百姓怨气满腹，吾谁欺，欺天乎？若郡县远遣吏上寿，盛称虚美，必髠，令屯田。”于是群臣不敢复言，其英断如此。"}],"path":"三笔/卷七/光武苻坚","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"1春，二月，車駕東巡。羣臣上言：「卽位三十年，宜封禪泰山。」詔曰：「卽位三十年，百姓怨氣滿腹，『吾誰欺，欺天乎！』『曾謂泰山不如林放乎！』何事汚七十二代之編錄！若郡縣遠遣吏上壽，盛稱虛美，必髡，令屯田。」於是羣臣不敢復言。","content_fanyi":"春季，二月，光武帝车驾东巡。群臣上言道：“陛下即位三十年，应当封禅泰山。”光武帝下诏说：“我即位三十年来，百姓怨气满腹，‘我欺骗谁？欺骗上天吗！’‘难道认为泰山之神不如林放吗！’为什么要玷污七十二代封禅贤君的编录！如有郡县从远方派遣官吏前来上寿祝贺，盛称虚美，必定处以髡刑，并责令屯田。”于是群臣不敢再提封禅之事。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，二月，车驾东巡。群臣上言：「即位三十年，宜封禅泰山。」诏曰：「即位三十年，百姓怨气满腹，『吾谁欺，欺天乎！』『曾谓泰山不如林放乎！』何事汚七十二代之编录！若郡县远遣吏上寿，盛称虚美，必髡，令屯田。」于是群臣不敢复言。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3474,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94ee93ec-db0e-11ef-b0ef-a0d3651f611f","zhang_TJZJ_id":"zttjzj_000682"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魯","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁","resolved_place_entity_id":506,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"94ee9401-db0e-11ef-a7ca-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"濟南","place_name_jianti_auto":"济南","resolved_place_entity_id":859,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"94ee9402-db0e-11ef-b7ea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"甲子，上幸魯濟南；閏月，癸丑，還宮。","content_fanyi":"甲子日，光武帝巡幸鲁国济南；闰三月癸丑日，返回宫中。","content_jianti_auto":"甲子，上幸鲁济南；闰月，癸丑，还宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3475,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"94ee93ff-db0e-11ef-b431-a0d3651f611f"},{"Ex