":"5秋，七月，丁酉，上行幸鲁；冬，十一月，丁酉，还宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3479,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"94ee940a-db0e-11ef-bb09-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賈復","people_name_jianti_auto":"贾复","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"94ee940e-db0e-11ef-a766-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"袁","people_name_jianti_auto":"袁","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"94ee940f-db0e-11ef-ae3c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"諡法：能補前過曰剛。此直以賈復剛毅而諡之耳。考異曰：本傳在三十一年。今從袁紀。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谥法：能补前过曰刚。此直以贾复刚毅而谥之耳。考异曰：本传在三十一年。今从袁纪。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"94ee940d-db0e-11ef-8911-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"復","people_name_jianti_auto":"复","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"94ee9416-db0e-11ef-a3c0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"常以復自從也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"常以复自从也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"94ee9415-db0e-11ef-a701-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":9,"link_death_year":55,"link_td_description":"贾复，字君文，南阳冠军人。中国东汉初期军事、政治人物。他协助汉光武帝建立东汉，虽然是儒生出身，但勇猛异常，常随汉光武帝左右，屡次冲锋在前，身负十二处创伤而不矜伐其功，为“云台二十八将”第三位。他曾先后担任执金吾与左将军等职，天下平定后又配合刘秀“偃干戈，修文德”的政策，主动与邓禹一同削减军队，推行儒学，为在“退功臣而进文吏”的局面下仍然能够参与讨论国家大事的三位列侯之一。","link_td_id":"Q10001394","link_td_number_id":740367,"people_name":"膠東剛侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"胶东刚侯","people_xingming":"贾复","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":